"Needs Accessibility access. KeyHue only notices that the main window changed; it never reads window titles or contents." = "Needs Accessibility access. KeyHue only notices that the main window changed; it never reads window titles or contents.";
"Restore brings back the input source you last used in that app or window; apps and windows KeyHue hasn't seen switch to %@. Coming back from another app follows When Switching Apps, so with Keep As Is the front window keeps the current input source. Windows are remembered only until KeyHue quits. The window option needs Accessibility access: KeyHue only notices that the main window changed and never reads window titles or contents." = "Restore brings back the input source you last used in that app or window; apps and windows KeyHue hasn't seen switch to %@. Coming back from another app follows When Switching Apps, so with Keep As Is the front window keeps the current input source. Windows are remembered only until KeyHue quits. The window option needs Accessibility access: KeyHue only notices that the main window changed and never reads window titles or contents.";
"To remember the input source for each window of an app, KeyHue needs Accessibility access." = "To remember the input source for each window of an app, KeyHue needs Accessibility access.";

